      "id": "claim_5aa43a74ddb04e14961ee7dca9a67e54",
      "statement": "The system has three tiers connected by WebSockets: a web client (Next.js), a control plane (Cloudflare Workers with one Durable Object per session plus a shared D1 database), and a data plane (Modal/Daytona/Vercel/OpenComputer/E2B sandboxes running a Python runtime and the OpenCode agent).",
      "evidence": [
