      "statement": "A session is backed by one Durable Object instance named by the session id (SESSION.idFromName) whose embedded SQLite holds session state, participants, messages, events, artifacts, sandbox state, and WebSocket-client mapping for hibernation recovery; global cross-session state lives in a shared D1 database.",
