    {
      "id": "claim_2c266684453f4f5f9f9f6438e760c17c",
      "statement": "The web app is a framework-free BFF: it signs control-plane API requests with its sig1 service credential, forwards only Better Auth's opaque session cookie, resolves the enabled sign-in providers from the control plane at request time, and never holds provider secrets or admission policy; browser resource requests require the signed service:web channel and the session cookie.",
