      "id": "claim_94c8d1fb6c17455cb894f7b2c16ec50b",
      "statement": "Strictly isolated per-session runtime: the Session Durable Object is a thin platform adapter that on first activation applies the SQLite schema then eagerly builds the whole collaborator graph via createSessionRuntime (session/components.ts is the composition root); a throw during construction leaves the activation uninitialized so the next event retries.",
