      "statement": "Each sandbox runs the Python sandbox-runtime: entrypoint.py composes a supervisor that starts the OpenCode server, a bridge process maintaining the WebSocket to the control plane with heartbeat and event forwarding, plus code-server, web terminal, and optional VNC; boot mode (fresh, snapshot_restore, repo_image, build) is derived from process env.",
