      "statement": "Child sessions let an agent-spawned child be continued by the parent via send-child-prompt through the child's normal durable queue; the parent token is never exchanged for the child's sandbox token, the direct parent-child relationship is verified in D1 and again in the child DO, and the queued prompt is attributed to the child owner with source agent.",
